      StyleBox["\<\"Figure 7. Two-lane NaSch with 150 vehicles (75 per lane \
initially). The running counter in the title shows cumulative lane-change \
events; each occurs when a vehicle would otherwise have to brake but the \
other lane satisfies the gap-acceptance criteria. (MP4: \
Wolfram/results/anim_nasch_2lane.mp4.)\"\>",
       StripOnInput->False,
